        prov:wasDerivedFrom <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/b527a03f163994a07bd008d5b308a54ec56094a4/models/2026-delphi10000-drosophila-ananassae-turing-wavelength-s0.py#L188-L231> .
    <https://w3id.org/delphi/resource/evidence/morphoeval-delphi10000-drosophila-ananassae-turing-wavelength-s0-morphometric-validation-2> a pk:EvidenceItem ;
